flowchart TD
    A[Discover datasets] --> B[Register owner, class, purpose, region]
    B --> C{Retention and recovery assessment}
    C -->|Still active| D[Keep in Redshift / S3 Standard]
    C -->|Historical| E[Unload partition to encrypted S3]
    E --> F[Validate manifest, counts, schema, checksum]
    F --> G[Apply lifecycle policy by tags]
    G --> H[Transition to appropriate S3 class]
    H --> I{Restore request?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Approve and restore to temporary prefix]
    J --> K[Validate and consume with least privilege]
    I -->|No| L{Expiry date reached?}
    L -->|No| H
    L -->|Yes| M{Legal hold / exception?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Pause expiry and escalate]
    M -->|No| O[Expire and preserve evidence]
